- Explicit loop over bandwidths in KDE forward pass to compute Gaussian kernels, which can be vectorized by broadcasting the bandwidth dimension across the distance matrix: [
  /workspace/Learnable Kernel Density Estimation for Graphs [lQxSGO2kBa]/supplementary/LGKDE-SupplementaryMaterial/LGKDE-Codes/model.py:25-33
